h section of the city. To reach the park you can take line 8 on the metro to Shiguang Road.","wpu":"Gongqing Forest Park","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/The_lawn_on_Gongqing_Forest_Park.jpg/960px-The_lawn_on_Gongqing_Forest_Park.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"}],"about":{"ds":"Shanghai is a provincial-level direct-administered municipality in China. It has a population of 30,050,000 in the urban area as of 2026, thus making it China's most populous city and more broadly the fifth-largest city in the world by population. The city is located on the southern estuary of the Yangtze River, with the Huangpu River bisecting the city.","wpu":"Shanghai","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Huangpu_Park_20124-Shanghai_%2832208802494%29.jpg/960px-Huangpu_Park_20124-Shanghai_%2832208802494%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},"wk":"2026-10-18"}